      "t": "The confrontation spills into the kitchen as Vika brings up the rumor about Chef Barinov reciting poetry to Louis, causing Viktor Petrovich's anger-management technique to implode completely. Watching the chaos, Max reflects on how every reckless act eventually leaves behind only ruins.",
